      <title>深海之光：一位石油AI先行者的韧性与远见</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/article-20250915104005659-4/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 15 Sep 2025 10:40:05 +0800</pubDate>
